{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107058","id":2561534606,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6YreqO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107058","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107058.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107058.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107058","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107058/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107058/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107058/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6929823838ee3e36380d9eb8e8d2b294f8b417c9","number":107058,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix various race conditions with capturing of script backtraces","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #107056.\r\n\r\nThis PR addresses a couple of things:\r\n\r\n1. `ScriptServer::capture_script_backtraces` was not locking `languages_mutex` as it probably should have, and in general was calling `ScriptServer` methods through its static interface when it could just have accessed the state directly instead.\r\n2. `ScriptServer::capture_script_backtraces` should rightfully have been checking `ScriptServer::languages_ready` as part of its implementation rather than relying on the caller to call `ScriptServer::are_languages_initialized`, since it doesn't really make much sense to do anything without them being ready anyway, and having the caller do it technically opens you up to a potential race condition.\r\n3. Adds the quick hack for the likely static destruction problem mentioned in [#107056](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107056).\r\n\r\nThat last one is very much a hack, and should ideally be fixed properly in short order. However, as mentioned in #107056, it would seem to me that the best way to do so is to convert `ScriptServer` into a proper singleton with a well-defined lifetime instead, which strikes me as a somewhat pervasive/scary change to rush in at the last minute like this.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_ur